WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.054
Saturn.

00:01.754 --> 00:06.260
A calm, yellowish point, about as bright as the brightest stars.

00:06.710 --> 00:09.221
The rings need a small telescope.

00:09.671 --> 00:17.950
About every fifteen years they turn edge-on to us and almost vanish, because they are thousands of times wider than they are thick.
